### Monitored accounts — all routes require a session (run auth.http login first).

@pageSize = 20
# Known to x-api-mock but not seeded, so adding it does not conflict.
@newHandle = PressSec

### List monitored accounts (offset pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts?limit={{pageSize}}&offset=0

### Add a monitored account by handle (resolved through the X API / mock)
# @name addAccount
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "handle": "{{newHandle}}"
}

### Remove the account added above
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{addAccount.response.body.data.id}}
